<title>UK: Psion appoints Myers group managing director.</title>
<headline>Psion appoints Myers group managing director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British hand-held computers firms Psion Plc on Tuesday announced the appointment of Nicholas Myers as group managing director.</p>
<p>Myers, previously managing director of Psion Software Plc, had been acting group managing director since the beginning of the year following the illness of David Potter. Myers joined the company in 1981 and was appointed to the board in 1984.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
